{"ID":"20240506100059-795c3r5","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100059-795c3r5","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100059-795c3r5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627112310-79a2lwt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612140622-6zes8th\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627113502-3g9rgwp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"244蜚虻（虻虫、牛虻）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821171444"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240821171444-1x6e8zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821171444-1x6e8zz","updated":"20240821171444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 535px;","style":"width: 525px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛虻 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛虻 3-20240821171444-kby4dtw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 525px;\" parent-style=\"width: 535px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627112225-ekzafql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627112225-ekzafql","updated":"20240821170817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 598px;","style":"width: 588px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛虻2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛虻2-20240627112225-6z5d9mz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 588px;\" parent-style=\"width: 598px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 537px;","style":"width: 527px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛虻"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛虻-20240821170817-sb63kws.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 527px;\" parent-style=\"width: 537px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627112544-c37e31o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627112544-c37e31o","updated":"20240821170826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 503px;","style":"width: 493px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛虻4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛虻4-20240627112615-h27oxub.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 493px;\" parent-style=\"width: 503px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 573px;","style":"width: 563px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛虻3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛虻3-20240627112544-xu954gb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 563px;\" parent-style=\"width: 573px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240627113001-nxr3fa7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627113001-nxr3fa7","updated":"20240821170849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 493px;","style":"width: 483px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛虻6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛虻6-20240627113001-5sxj95s.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 483px;\" parent-style=\"width: 493px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 579px;","style":"width: 569px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛虻8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛虻8-20240627113157-rjwqkwo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 569px;\" parent-style=\"width: 579px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821171118-xkv2lts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821171118-xkv2lts","updated":"20240821171310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 382px;","style":"width: 372px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛虻 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛虻 2-20240821171202-zg0bo0t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 372px;\" parent-style=\"width: 382px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 726px;","style":"width: 716px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牛虻 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牛虻 1-20240821171117-kslvt9f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 716px;\" parent-style=\"width: 726px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612141023-9saez3u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141023-9saez3u"}},{"ID":"20240612141034-xdhobtm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141034-xdhobtm","updated":"20240612141038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141034-aq0f7ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141034-aq0f7ao","updated":"20240612141034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大如蜜蜂而扁。微黄绿色。好啖牛马血。伺其腹满。掩取干之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141034-2hf483t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141034-2hf483t","updated":"20240612141034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦。气微寒。有毒。肝经血分药。主逐瘀血。破血积坚痞。症瘕寒热。通利血脉及九窍。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141034-sha58az","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141034-sha58az","updated":"20240612141034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦胜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141034-1pt4k5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141034-1pt4k5s","updated":"20240612141034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫二〔论〕用虻之义。与水蛭同。先哲释抵当汤云。血蓄于下。必以咸为主。故水蛭咸寒为君血为中止凡病患气血虚甚。形质瘦损者。忌之。伤寒发黄。脉沉结。少腹硬。如小便不利者。为无血聚。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141034-gdblefm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141034-gdblefm","updated":"20240612141034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕入丸散。去翅足。炒熟用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141023-dfjjzs8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141023-dfjjzs8"}},{"ID":"20240612141025-ae2g2za","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141025-ae2g2za","updated":"20240612141028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141025-az2q78u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141025-az2q78u","updated":"20240612141025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘寒有毒．入足厥阴经．功专攻血．遍行经络．堕胎只在须臾．非气足有畜血者勿服．去足翅炒．恶麻黄．一各蜚虫．"}]},{"ID":"20240612141207-8ips3wt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141207-8ips3wt"}},{"ID":"20240612141208-7klmkj1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141208-7klmkj1","updated":"20240612141212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141208-2qjl3zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141208-2qjl3zp","updated":"20240612141208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（化生）破血堕胎"}]},{"ID":"20240612141208-0ncw74e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141208-0ncw74e","updated":"20240612141208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫（专入肝）。微苦微咸。气寒有毒。善啮牛马猪血。因其性以为用。故以之治一切血结诸病。故凡病血蓄而见身黄脉结。腹痛如狂。小便利。并坚瘕积块疟母。九窍闭塞者。服之自克有效。以苦泄结。咸走血故也。且色青入肝。服之宜入肝脏血分而散之矣！（河间云。虻食血而治血。因其性而为用也。）仲景合水蛭。用此以治太阳蓄血如狂。亦是此意。但性属恶毒。以此治病。是犹刑罚之治盗贼。非得已也。去翅足炒用。恶麻黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140417-ozfy9wv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140417-ozfy9wv"}},{"ID":"20240612141012-07dj7nb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141012-07dj7nb","updated":"20240612141019"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141012-ljaul8p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141012-ljaul8p","updated":"20240612141012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名蜚虫．泻、破血．"}]},{"ID":"20240612141012-3ee7u36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141012-3ee7u36","updated":"20240612141012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒有毒．攻血遍行经络．堕胎只在须臾．（青色入肝、专啖牛马之血、仲景用以逐血、因其性而取用者也．）非气足之人．实有畜血者．勿轻与．去足翅炒．恶麻黄．以上化生类．"}]},{"ID":"20240612140417-txdeoaa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140417-txdeoaa"}},{"ID":"20240612140609-w2wpw4t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140609-w2wpw4t","updated":"20240612140613"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140609-9psj6f6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140609-9psj6f6","updated":"20240612140609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】蜚虻。味苦微寒。主逐淤血，破下血积坚痞癥瘕，寒热，通利血脉及九窍。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140609-jwwjfid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140609-jwwjfid","updated":"20240612140609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，微寒。入足厥阴肝经。善破瘀血，能化宿癥。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140609-7dc7zv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140609-7dc7zv4","updated":"20240612140609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"抵当汤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在大黄。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治血结膀胱，少腹硬满。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄（庶/虫）虫丸"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在大黄。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之治虚劳腹满，内有干血，以其破瘀而消癥也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140609-wh05muz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140609-wh05muz","updated":"20240612140609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫苦寒，专破浮结之血，最堕胎孕。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140609-tpopjnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140609-tpopjnm","updated":"20240612140609"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒枯，去翅足，研细用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141132-to4hhpf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141132-to4hhpf"}},{"ID":"20240612141134-iixq2la","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141134-iixq2la","updated":"20240612141139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141134-vdcdnb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141134-vdcdnb6","updated":"20240612141134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即蜚虻"}]},{"ID":"20240612141134-qu4jpp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141134-qu4jpp7","updated":"20240612141134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦，微寒，有毒。入足厥阴经血分。遍行经络，能攻真气营运不到之血。治两目赤痛及伤泪出。配丹皮，治扑坠瘀血。（宿血在骨者，二味治之。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612141155-wazikez","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141155-wazikez"}},{"ID":"20240612141157-i8p4gbw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141157-i8p4gbw","updated":"20240612141201"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《本草害利》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141157-tyn32oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141157-tyn32oy","updated":"20240612141157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔害〕有毒，专啖牛马之血，逐瘀甚疾。伤寒发黄，脉沉细，少腹 ，如小便不利者，为无血也。症非蓄血不宜用。若瘀未结者，尤不宜用也。女子月水不通，由于脾胃薄弱，肝血枯竭，而非血结闭塞者，不宜用，孕妇腹中有瘕聚，不宜用。凡病气血虚甚者，形质瘦损，非气足之人，实有蓄血者，勿可妄投。恶麻黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141157-n6mca7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141157-n6mca7n","updated":"20240612141157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔利〕苦寒，攻血，遍行经络，堕胎只在须臾。色青入肝，泻血破瘀。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141157-u6dd98f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141157-u6dd98f","updated":"20240612141157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕五月蜚虫啖马牛血者，伺其腹满，掩取干之，去翅足，炒熟用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141145-3o5pwuz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141145-3o5pwuz"}},{"ID":"20240612141146-2fn90lo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141146-2fn90lo","updated":"20240612141150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141146-w3f0oi3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141146-w3f0oi3","updated":"20240612141146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气微寒，味苦，平。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141146-19vqu1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141146-19vqu1r","updated":"20240612141146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主目中赤痛， 伤泪出，瘀血血闭，寒热酸 ，无子。炒，去翅、足。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141122-5wzx2qg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141122-5wzx2qg"}},{"ID":"20240612141123-myypx09","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141123-myypx09","updated":"20240612141127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141123-cryc924","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141123-cryc924","updated":"20240612141123"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"破积堕胎．味苦寒而有毒．入肝行血．泻大便以推陈．（虻虫即牛虻．形如蜂．专啖牛马之血．五六月取之．晒干用．苦寒有毒．入肝经．破血行血．与水蛭同性．但虻虫之性刚而猛．故服下即暴泻．药过即止．水蛭之性阴而险．服后虽不即泻．而延蔓之毒．未必即除．虻虫居陆而飞走．水蛭居水而潜伏．故于脏腑经络之间．缓急行守之治．又有不同也．亦能堕胎．）"}]},{"ID":"20240612141051-9fcxjj1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612141051-9fcxjj1"}},{"ID":"20240612141052-1fuc848","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612141052-1fuc848","updated":"20240612141056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻虫《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612141052-20hgfnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141052-20hgfnv","updated":"20240612141052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即蜚虻"}]},{"ID":"20240612141052-inm200p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141052-inm200p","updated":"20240612141052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦微寒有毒。即啖牛血蝇，去翅足炒用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141052-1f7qlcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141052-1f7qlcz","updated":"20240612141052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》逐瘀血，破血积坚痞症瘕寒热，通利血脉九窍。"}]},{"ID":"20240612141052-5vvwd8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612141052-5vvwd8j","updated":"20240612141052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虻食血而治血，因其性而为用，肝经血分药也。《本经》治症瘕寒热，是因症瘕而发寒热，与蜣螂治腹胀寒热不殊。仲景抵当汤丸水蛭、虻虫虽当并用，二物之纯阴悬殊。其治经闭用四物加蜚虻作丸服甚良。以破瘀血而不伤血也。苦走血，血结不行者，以苦攻之，其性虽缓，亦能堕胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140417-qcckkhb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140417-qcckkhb"}},{"ID":"20240612140559-2y1u52k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140559-2y1u52k","updated":"20240612140603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚虻《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140559-v8yvv9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140559-v8yvv9x","updated":"20240612140559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚虻，味苦，气微寒，有毒。逐瘀血血闭，寒热酸 。止两目赤疼， 伤泪出。通血脉九窍，治喉痹，破积血，症瘕痞坚亦治。此物视之可憎，用之以治瘀血之症，实救命之药也，药笼中断宜预备。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140559-dg0mu08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140559-dg0mu08","updated":"20240612140559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畜血之症，必须水蛭以消之，否则瘀血硬痛，必变发黄之症。今人畏惧水蛭，谢绝不用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140559-kb11unm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140559-kb11unm","updated":"20240612140559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当以虻虫代水蛭，则畜血病可解也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140559-ifub7e0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140559-ifub7e0","updated":"20240612140559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问蜚虻食人之血，何仲景夫子以治伤寒之症？曰∶伤寒之变症不同，失于不汗，有气结、血结之病。气结，可用草木之药以散气。而血结，必须蜚虻、水蛭以散血也。但气结与血结，何以辨之？气结者，小便必不利；血结者，小便必利也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140559-hhyovxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140559-hhyovxo","updated":"20240612140559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又问血结者，必须用蜚虻矣，然何以知是血结之病？曰∶大约气结、血结，身大热，肠中俱有燥屎作痛。但血结者，止小便利，异于气结也。舍蜚虻，又何物以散其瘀血哉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140417-hwxn32q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140417-hwxn32q"}},{"ID":"20240612140541-mts9zwh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140541-mts9zwh","updated":"20240612140545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚虻《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140541-w957hej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140541-w957hej","updated":"20240612140541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒，有毒。主逐瘀血，破下血积，坚痞，症瘕寒热，通利血脉及九窍，女子月水不通，积聚，除贼血在胸腹五脏者，及喉痹结塞。生江夏川谷，五月取，腹有血者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140500-dftj108","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140500-dftj108"}},{"ID":"20240612140531-8bfqc6y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140531-8bfqc6y","updated":"20240612140535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚虻《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140531-nx8a027","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140531-nx8a027","updated":"20240612140531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有毒．主女子月水不通，积聚，除贼血在胸腹五脏者，及喉痹结塞．生江夏．五月腹有血者良．"}]},{"ID":"20240612140531-y7tvnkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140531-y7tvnkw","updated":"20240612140531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶蜚虻，味苦，微寒．主逐瘀血，破下血积，坚痞症瘕，寒热，通利血脉及九窍．生川谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240612140500-gy9bbtk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140500-gy9bbtk"}},{"ID":"20240612140519-bz7arpq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140519-bz7arpq","updated":"20240612140523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚虻《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140519-3sqwt4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140519-3sqwt4q","updated":"20240612140519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即今啖牛血者，方家呼为虻虫。味苦寒，有毒。主逐瘀血，破血积坚痞、 瘕寒热。通血脉，利九窍，女子月水不通，除贼血在胸腹五脏，治喉痹，消积脓，堕胎。去翅足炒，恶麻黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140500-h0iqj3r","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140500-h0iqj3r"}},{"ID":"20240612140501-zsaqf41","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140501-zsaqf41","updated":"20240612140510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚虻《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140501-dbtsrf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140501-dbtsrf8","updated":"20240612140501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦微寒，主逐瘀血，破下血，积坚，痞癥瘕，寒热，通利血脉及九窍，生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140501-omuyh7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140501-omuyh7k","updated":"20240612140501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚕蛹生蛾，营飞逞快，饱饫血腥，猛同针虿，毒化坚凝，苦攻瘀败，譬彼多藏，厚亡堪喟。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140501-iedzdut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140501-iedzdut","updated":"20240612140501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈藏器曰：木虻是叶内者，蜚虻是已飞者，正如蚕蛹与蛾耳。梁武帝诗：黄鸟营飞时。陶宏景曰：啖牛马血，因其腹满，掩取干之。寇宗奭曰：大如蜜蜂，腹凹褊，微黄绿色。李时珍曰：虻食血而治血。成无己曰：血结不行者，以苦攻之。老子：多藏必厚亡。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140417-wo3acfr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140417-wo3acfr"}},{"ID":"20240612140419-b0y2v6v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140419-b0y2v6v","updated":"20240612140422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚虻《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140419-atdei6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140419-atdei6e","updated":"20240612140419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」虻虫"}]},{"ID":"20240612140419-119g87g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140419-119g87g","updated":"20240612140419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」苦、微寒、有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140419-lsb6ssc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140419-lsb6ssc","updated":"20240612140419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612140419-yfsk3mg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140419-yfsk3mg","updated":"20240612140419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、蛇螫血出。取虻虫初食牛马血腹满者二十个，烧过，研为末，开水送服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140419-qw77m30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140419-qw77m30","updated":"20240612140419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、因病去胎。用虻虫十个，炙过，研为末，酒送服，胎即下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140419-jj6acdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140419-jj6acdx","updated":"20240612140419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、跌坠瘀血。用虻虫二十个、牡丹皮一两，共研为末，酒送服一匙，血即化为水。若骨节中有宿血。则两味取等量。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140423-ai2cvdf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140423-ai2cvdf"}},{"ID":"20240612140450-1dnhbve","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140450-1dnhbve","updated":"20240612140454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蜚虻《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140450-k1bcb3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140450-k1bcb3t","updated":"20240612140450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经中品）"}]},{"ID":"20240612140450-gzmc8kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140450-gzmc8kl","updated":"20240612140450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】苦，微寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140450-x62gvuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140450-x62gvuj","updated":"20240612140450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】逐瘀血，破血积、坚痞、症瘕寒热，通利血脉及九窍。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140450-202r1zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140450-202r1zz","updated":"20240612140450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶生江夏川谷，牛马所在，都有之。形类蜜蜂，腹四褊微黄绿色，嘴锐而利，若锋 然。春半后，秋半前出，茂暑繁盛，腹有血者良。法取五月。修治，入丸散去翅足，熬熟用；汤法亦同。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140450-9snsi4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140450-9snsi4t","updated":"20240612140450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【 】曰∶蜚虻，一名虻虫、陆虻也。飞咂牛马血，嘴如芒刺然，性颇贪饕，腹满犹咂不已。用逐瘀血，破血积坚痞，症瘕而成寒热者，遂其性，尽出其所留积而后快。 血中有眚，乃积乃留，眚去血行，流不盈矣。通利血脉者，概手足二十四经隧而言，十二焉从头而走足，十二焉自足而走头，风马牛不相及者，而概咂焉。则凡经隧逆走头而逆走足者，乃积乃留，各遂其性，乃行乃流矣。故血失所行，血失所留者，清阳不走上窍而留，浊阴不走下窍而积，而行焉，而流焉，何窍不通，何窍不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140451-yyomrrv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140451-yyomrrv"}},{"ID":"20240612140620-9m338nl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-9m338nl","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：虻虫"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-ihz7agi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-ihz7agi","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-34s2kox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-34s2kox","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ménɡ Chónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-gl1gint","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-gl1gint","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-jx29wr6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-jx29wr6","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 牛虻、牛蚊子、牛蝇、牛苍蝇、瞎蒙"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-27crr61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-27crr61","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-u8dqwkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-u8dqwkh","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 虻科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"复带虻"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Tabanus bivittatus Matsumura 或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"鹿虻"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"T. chrysurus Loew.的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"雌虻成虫"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏秋捕捉雌虫，捏其头部致死，晒干或阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-a6q7e2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-a6q7e2n","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-np00e5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-np00e5i","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 炒虻虫：文火微炒，取出去足翅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-dscbrks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-dscbrks","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-6vti1z2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-6vti1z2","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，微寒。有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-rhln2tt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-rhln2tt","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-lupntwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-lupntwf","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇及无瘀积者禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-hkdqdzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-hkdqdzh","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-jgndcun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-jgndcun","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 破瘀散结，痛经堕胎。用于血瘀经闭，跌打损伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-dce8juh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-dce8juh","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-ljeibe0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-ljeibe0","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 0.5～1钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-q05emcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-q05emcv","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-5d5d9dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-5d5d9dw","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-jz40ybo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-jz40ybo","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：虻虫"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-4y4hgjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-4y4hgjz","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-3b0xhmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-3b0xhmw","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ménɡ Chónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-590bu1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-590bu1x","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-0cvareo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-0cvareo","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜚虻（《本经）），牛虻（《本草崇原》），牛蚊子（《中药形性经验鉴别法》），绿头猛钻（《青海药材》），牛苍蝇（《浙江中药手册》），瞎虻虫、瞎蚂蜂（《河北药材》），瞎蠓（《中药志》），牛魔蚊（《四川中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-g1uru6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-g1uru6u","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-c626ofx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-c626ofx","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-7hsmy3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-7hsmy3f","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-3hkml4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-3hkml4t","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为虻科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"复带虻"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或其他同属昆虫的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"雌性全虫"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。6～8月间捕捉。用蝇拍轻轻拍取，用线穿起，晒干或阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-0phs0do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-0phs0do","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-oskw386","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-oskw386","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 平常居于草丛及树林中。性喜阳光，多在白昼活动。全国大部地区均有分布。产广西、四川、浙江、江苏、湖南、湖北、山西、河南、辽宁等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-n7qofyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-n7qofyy","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-crnmhdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-crnmhdr","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 雌虻体长13～17毫米，黄绿色。复眼大型，无细毛，中部有1条细窄的黑色横带。额黄色或略带浅灰；头顶被有短毛。触角黄色，第3节肥大，基部具有粗钝的背突。唇基和颊黄灰色。下颚须第2节浅黄色，被有白色并杂有黑色的短毛。中胸背板、侧板、腹板灰黄色，被有黄色短毛并杂有黑色和黄灰色长毛，翅透明无斑，平衡棒黄色。足3对，中、后足的股节基部1/3处灰色；前足跗节及前足胫节端部黑色；中、后足跗节的端部黑褐色。腹部暗黄灰色；第1～3或1～4腹节背板两侧有大的黄色斑点，中间有暗黄色纵带，宽约为腹部宽度的1/4～1/3。腹部被有稠密的黄色或黄灰色短毛，有时夹杂有黑色短毛。腹面灰色，第1～2或第1～3腹板的两侧黄色。雄虻形状相似，但体较小，复眼被有纤细的灰色短毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-2l8ki23","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-2l8ki23","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雌虻吸食牛、马、驴等家畜血液；雄虻不吸血，只吸食植物的汁液。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-b934vww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-b934vww","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-vzu857e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-vzu857e","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的虫体呈长椭圆形，长1.5～2厘米，宽5～10毫米。头部呈黑褐色，复眼大多已经脱落；胸部黑褐色，背面呈壳状而光亮，翅长超过尾部；胸部下面突出，黑棕色，具足3对，多碎断。腹部棕黄色，有6个体节。质松而脆，易破碎。气臭，味苦咸。以个大、完整、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-38evm6g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-38evm6g","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-tc1yrd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-tc1yrd6","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，除去翅、足；或用文火微炒用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-0fytzcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-0fytzcx","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-u0o48ev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-u0o48ev","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-qlwt1e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-qlwt1e3","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"肝经血分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-rchnxi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-rchnxi2","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《要药分剂》：\"入肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-x9o71b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-x9o71b7","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-m5key72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-m5key72","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，凉，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-lmolunp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-lmolunp","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-zz1nhkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-zz1nhkz","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-p3k38jj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-p3k38jj","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《医林纂要》：\"辛苦咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-7tekvds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-7tekvds","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-3qte7jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-3qte7jz","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-xmy9wcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-xmy9wcl","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药性论》：\"恶麻黄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-re1nr52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-re1nr52","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《品汇精要》：\"妊娠不可服，服之堕胎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-eag0ux4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-eag0ux4","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"伤寒发黄，脉沉急，少腹鞕，如小便不利者为无血证，非蓄血也，不宜用；瘀血未审的者不宜用；女子月水不通，由于脾胃薄弱，肝血枯竭，而非血结闭塞者不宜用；孕妇腹中有症瘕积聚，不宜用。凡病气血虚甚，形质瘦损者忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-dfktoue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-dfktoue","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-vwkyap7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-vwkyap7","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 逐瘀，破积，通经。治症瘕，积聚，少腹蓄血，血滞经闭，扑损瘀血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-elpv8q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-elpv8q1","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主逐瘀血，破下血积、坚痞、症瘕，寒热。通利血脉及九窍。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-ixovi3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-ixovi3h","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"主女子月水不通，积聚，除贼血在胸腹五脏者，及喉痹结塞。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-2jkjgin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-2jkjgin","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"破症结，消积脓，堕胎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-bw5v939","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-bw5v939","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-dodb9n7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-dodb9n7","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，0.5～1钱；研末1～2分；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-kxixvtd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-kxixvtd","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-xszwsrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-xszwsrw","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治太阳病，身黄，脉沉结，少腹鞕，小便自利，其人如狂者：水蛭（熬）、虻虫（去翅、足）各三十个，桃仁二十个（去皮、尖），大黄三两（酒洗）。上四味，以水五升，煮取三升，去滓。温服-升，不下，更服。（《伤寒论》抵当汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-2f7c3ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-2f7c3ja","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治月经不行，或产后恶露脐腹作痛：熟地黄四两，虻虫（去头、翅，炒）、水蛭（糯米同炒黄，去糯米）、桃仁（去皮、尖）各五十枚。上为末，蜜丸桐子大。每服五、七丸，空心，温酒下。（《妇人良方》地黄通经丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-61ckpqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-61ckpqm","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治腕折瘀血：虻虫二十枚，牡丹一两。上二味，治下筛，酒服方寸匕，血化为水。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-5mmr2cy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-5mmr2cy","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治肿毒：虻虫、松香等分。为末，置膏药中贴患部。（《现代实用中药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-klnsvj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-klnsvj9","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-xzx98il","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-xzx98il","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"成无己云，苦走血，血结不行者，以苦攻之，故治蓄血用虻虫，乃肝经血分药也，古方多用，今人稀使。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-dif55p1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-dif55p1","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"蜚虻，其用大略与蟅虫相似，而此则苦胜，苦能泄结，性善啮牛、马诸畜血，味应有咸，咸能走血。故主积聚症瘕一切血结为病，如《经》所言也。苦寒又能泄三焦火邪迫血上壅，闭塞咽喉，故主喉痹结塞也。今人以其有毒多不用，然仲景抵当汤、丸，大黄蟅虫丸中咸入之，以其散脏腑宿血结积有效也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-6hj1q0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-6hj1q0f","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》：\"虻虫，《本经》治症瘕寒热，是因症瘕而发寒热，与蜣螂治腹胀寒热不殊。仲景抵当汤、丸，水蛭、虻虫虽当并用，二物之纯险悬殊。其治经闭，用四物加蜚虻作丸服，以破瘀而不伤血也。苦走血，血结不行者，以苦攻之，其性虽缓，亦能堕胎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-vpj70j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-vpj70j4","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药征续编》：\"按用虻虫之方，曰破积血，曰下血，曰畜血，曰有久瘀血，曰有瘀血，曰妇人经水不利下，曰为有血，曰当下血，曰瘀热在里，曰如狂，曰喜忘，是皆为血证谛也。然不谓一身瘀血也，但少腹有瘀血者，此物能下之，故少腹鞕满，或曰少腹满，不问有瘀血否，是所以为其证也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-okc0ix1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-okc0ix1","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-3pdt2fv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-3pdt2fv","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-9dxgyx0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-9dxgyx0","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：虻虫"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-q3v69w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-q3v69w3","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-s6emsk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-s6emsk5","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ménɡ Chónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-co87kcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-co87kcm","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-amyf2k9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-amyf2k9","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 蜚虻、牛虻、牛蚊子、绿头猛钻、牛苍蝇、瞎虻虫、瞎蚂蜂、瞎蠓、牛魔蚊、牛蝇子、瞎眼蠓"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-gljq0j2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-gljq0j2","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-0vmyn65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-0vmyn65","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Gadfly"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-y03k9rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-y03k9rj","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-2cszjoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-2cszjoq","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《本草经集注》。《别录》：虻虫，生江夏川谷。五月取，腹有血者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-pfly6nf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-pfly6nf","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-f6i9gko","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-f6i9gko","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为虻科恬动物华虻及其同尾多种昆虫和黄虻属双斑黄虻的雌性全体。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-iekiu2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-iekiu2r","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Tabanus mandarinus Schiner2.Atylotus bivittateinus Takahasi"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-iwod2gu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-iwod2gu","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：夏、秋季捕捉，捕后用沸水烫死，洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-wap14d9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-wap14d9","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-4aptabh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-4aptabh","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.雌虫吸食牛、马等动物血液，雄虫不吸血，吸食植物汁液。常居于草丛及树林中性喜阳光，多在白昼活动。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-dpdhywr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-dpdhywr","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.成虫白日活动，喜强烈阳光。雌虫吸食牲畜的血液。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-3jopiis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-3jopiis","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.全国各地均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-6wdmnl9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-6wdmnl9","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.广泛分布于东北、华北及华东各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-wr1tgec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-wr1tgec","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-xj6eh4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-xj6eh4v","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.华虻，雌虫体长16-18mm，灰黑色。前额黄灰色，基胛近卵圆形，黄棕色。触角第1环节基部棕红色，有明显锐有突起，翅透明，翅脉棕色。胸部背板灰色，有5条明显黑灰纵带。腹部圆钝形，有明显的白斑。雄虫与雌虫相似，较雌虫稍大，仅腹部呈圆锥形。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-k2t68ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-k2t68ki","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.双斑黄虻，雌虫体长13-17mm，黄绿色。眼大型，中部有一条细窄的黑色横带。前额黄色或略带淡灰色。触角橙黄色，第3节有明显钝角突。翅透明，翅脉黄色。腹部暗黄灰色，多金黄色毛及少数黑毛。背板两侧具大块黄色斑，腹板灰色。雄虫与雌虫相似，但体较小。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-4cnvmxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-4cnvmxk","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-xjnsgqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-xjnsgqf","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴定：（1）华虻，干燥的虫体呈长椭圆形，长l.3-1.7cm，宽5-10mm。头部呈黑褐色，复眼大多已经脱落；胸部黑褐色，背面呈壳状而光亮，翅长超过尾部，胸部下面突出，灰色，有5条明显黑灰纵带，具足3对，多碎断。腹部棕黄色，有明显的白斑，有6个体节。质松而脆。气臭，味苦、咸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-mur653t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-mur653t","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2） 双斑黄虻，黄绿色，眼大型，中央有1条细横的黑色带；翅透明，翅脉黄色；腹部暗灰黄色，有较多的金黄色毛茸及少数黑色毛茸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-yxobabi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-yxobabi","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴定：（1）华虻，单眼呈钝六边形，中间有凹陷，排列整齐、紧密。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-i2pryms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-i2pryms","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）双斑黄虻，单眼呈钝六边形，排列疏松。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-v6uls0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-v6uls0t","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-jla24r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-jla24r1","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含蛋白质、氨基酸、胆固醇及钙、镁、磷、铁、钴、铜、锰、锶、锌铝等24种无机元素。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-p58wbjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-p58wbjg","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-xtqyo6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-xtqyo6l","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.抗凝作用，虻虫在体外有较弱的抗凝血酶作用，体外和体内均有活化纤溶系统的作用。虻虫水提取物540mg/(kg/d)和270mg/(kg/d)灌胃，连续7天，均能显着延长大鼠的出血时间，显着减少血浆纤维蛋白原含量；大剂量组对血小板最大聚集率也有明显抑制作用。华虻水浸液560mg（生药）/kg或粗蛋白提取液150mg/kg灌胃，每日1次，连续7天，能显着减少家兔血浆中纤维蛋白原含量，抑制血小板粘附性，降低全血粘度比和血浆粘度比，并能一定程度地降低血细胞比容。这些实验表明虻虫可能通过降低血液的“粘、浓、凝、聚”，而发挥活血、逐瘀、破积和通经的临床效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-qhfpxz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-qhfpxz9","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对小肠功能的影响，虻虫水煎剂对小鼠离体回肠运动有明显抑制作用。灌胃给药，对小鼠小肠推进功能无明显影响。按千克体重计算，以相当于人用量的200倍，连续2天给小鼠灌服虻虫水煎液，也未见稀软便、粘液或腔血便。表明虻虫不阴止肠道水分的吸收，也无明显刺激作用，不但无“致泻作用，相反 使小鼠白天的排便次数明显减少。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-i55rfg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-i55rfg1","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.抗炎作用，虻虫提取物B、C和D组分80mg/kg，分别腹腔注射，均 能明显抑制大鼠角叉菜胶性足肿胀，其B组分作用较强，后者静注10-20mg/kg的阿司匹林。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-pjcdiai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-pjcdiai","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.镇痛作用，虻虫提取物A或B组分100mg/kg灌胃，能明显对抗苯醌（phenylquinone）所致小鼠扭体反应，其B 组分作用较强。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-hoytefb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-hoytefb","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.其他作用，虻虫对家兔离体子宫有兴奋作用，对内毒素所致肝出血性坏死病灶的形成有显着的抑制作用，虻虫醇提取物有明显溶血作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-92r76kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-92r76kl","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-2ly5tq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-2ly5tq4","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，除去翅、足；或用文火微炒用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-qwo9et9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-qwo9et9","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-z7i9ori","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-z7i9ori","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-tclm4rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-tclm4rb","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-gei8133","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-gei8133","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；微咸；性凉；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-cjdan3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-cjdan3u","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-soyycn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-soyycn1","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 气血虚者、孕妇及月经期均禁服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-4kmcoat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-4kmcoat","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-sy3o7dx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-sy3o7dx","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 破血通经；逐瘀消症。主血瘀经闭；产后恶露不尽；干血痨；少腹蓄血；症瘕积块；跌打伤痛；痈肿；喉痹"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-qdu10qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-qdu10qx","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-ntc22k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-ntc22k3","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5g-3g；研末，0.3-0.6g；或入丸剂。外用：适量，研末敷或调搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-p2wz54x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-p2wz54x","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-jrxn8rn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-jrxn8rn","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治太阳病，身黄，脉沉结，少腹鞕，小便自利，其人如狂者：水蛭(熬)、虻虫(去翅、足)各三十个，桃仁二十个(去皮、尖)，大黄三两(酒洗)。上四味，以水五升，煮取三升，去滓。温服一升，不下，更服。(《伤寒论》抵当汤)②治月经不行，或产后恶露脐腹作痛：熟地黄四两，虻虫(去头、翅，炒)、水蛭(糯米同炒黄，去糯米)、桃仁(去皮、尖)各五十枚。上为末，蜜丸桐子大。每服五、七丸：空心、温酒下。(《妇人良方》地黄通经丸)③治踠折瘀血：虻虫二十枚，牡丹一两。上二味，治下筛，酒服方寸匕，血化为水。(《千金方》)④治肿毒：虻虫、松香等分。为末，置膏药中贴患部。(《现代实用中药》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-3r91ow6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-3r91ow6","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-dgr292n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-dgr292n","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：成无己云，苦走血，血结不行者，以苦攻之，故治蓄血用虻虫，乃肝经血分药也。古方多用，今人稀使。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-s9mlwng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-s9mlwng","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：蜚虻，其用大略与ZHE虫相似，而此则苦胜，苦能泄结，性善啮牛、马诸畜血，味应有咸，咸能走血。故主积聚症瘕一切血结为病，如《经》所言也。苦寒又能泄三焦火邪迫血上壅，闭塞咽喉，故主喉痹结塞也。今人以其有毒多不用，然仲景抵当汤、丸，大黄ZHE虫丸中咸入之，以其散脏腑宿血结积有效也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-jbkbnqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-jbkbnqt","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经逢原》：虻虫，《本经》治症瘕寒热，是因症瘕而发寒热，与蜣螂治腹胀寒热不殊。仲最抵当汤、丸，水蛭、虻虫虽当并用，二物之纯险悬殊。其治经闭，用四物加蜚虻作丸服，以破瘀而不伤血也。苦走血，血结不行者，以苦攻之，其性虽缓，亦能堕胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-hvhdbxr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-hvhdbxr","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《药征续编》：按用虻虫之方，曰破积血，曰下血，曰畜血，曰有久瘀血，曰有瘀血，曰妇人经水不利下。曰为有血，曰当下血，曰瘀热在里，曰如狂，曰喜忘，是皆为血证谛也。然不谓一身瘀血也，但少腹有瘀血者，此物能下之，故少腹鞕满，或曰少腹满，不问有瘀血否，是所以为其证也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-ce7cn1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-ce7cn1n","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本经》：主逐瘀血，破下血积、坚痞、症瘕，寒热，通利血脉及九窍。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-2p3z1xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-2p3z1xh","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《别录》：主女子月水不通，积聚，除贼血在胸腹五脏者，及喉痹结塞。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-xe2ujfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-xe2ujfk","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《日华子本草》：破症结，消积脓，堕胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-tvk6gir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-tvk6gir","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612140620-4l5iphc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140620-4l5iphc","updated":"20240612140620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612140621-wid7zdu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612140621-wid7zdu"}},{"ID":"20240612140622-6zes8th","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612140622-6zes8th"}}]}